# the Song page while a song plays: the playing slot's bar fills through its bars (S1 four bars, then S2 one)
wait 300
tapkey w0
tap HOME
tapkey w1
tap HOME
wait 100
expect page Song
tapkey w0
tapkey w1
turn K1 -2
wait 50
turn K3 3
wait 50
turn K1 2
wait 100
shot song_progress0.png
tap PLAY
wait 1000
expect playing 1
shot song_progress1.png
wait 3000
shot song_progress2.png
wait 3900
shot song_progress3.png
wait 1500
shot song_progress4.png
tap PLAY
